<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Expansion Registry Audit</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-body: #0f1115;
            --bg-card: #16191e;
            --border-card: #2a2d35;
            --text-primary: #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: #9ca3af;
            --accent-green: #10b981; /* Emerald */
            --accent-gold: #f59e0b;
            --font-sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            --radius-md: 12px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-body);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            line-height: 1.5;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* Layout Container */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        /* Header (Visual Context) */
        header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;}
        .logo-icon { width: 24px; height: 24px; background: var(--accent-green); border-radius: 6px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: black; font-size: 14px;}

        /* Page Title Area */
        .page-header h4 { color: var(--text-secondary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .page-header h1 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .page-header p { color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .export-btn {
            float: right;
            background: #222;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            color: #ccc;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 13px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        /* --- TARGET AUDIT COMPONENT --- */
        .audit-target-wrapper {
            position: relative;
        }

        .live-region-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-green); /* Emerald Border as requested */
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05);
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Card Header */
        .card-top-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .card-title-group { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
        .status-badge {
            font-size: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .region-name {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .globe-icon { color: var(--accent-green); width: 18px; height: 18px; }

        /* Aggregate Tiles Grid */
        .metrics-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .metric-tile {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            min-height: 90px;
        }

        .metric-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .metric-value {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: white;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .metric-sub {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        /* CTA Button */
        .cta-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            padding-top: 20px;
        }

        .cta-button {
            background-color: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-green);
            color: var(--accent-green);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 13px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
        }

        /* Verdict Section */
        .verdict-section {
            margin-top: 30px;
            background: #1a1d23;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 24px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-green);
        }

        .verdict-title { 
            font-size: 14px; 
            font-weight: 700; 
            margin-bottom: 16px; 
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .verdict-list { list-style: none; }
        .verdict-item {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #d1d5db;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }
        .check-mark { color: var(--accent-green); font-weight: bold; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .live-region-card { padding: 16px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

    <!-- Visual Context Header -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo">
            <div class="logo-icon">G</div>
            Gorge Capital Intelligence
        </div>
        <nav style="color: #666; font-size: 13px;">
            Overview &nbsp; Master Matrix &nbsp; Projections &nbsp; Listings &nbsp; <span style="background:var(--accent-green); color:black; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px;">Regions</span>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Page Title -->
    <section class="page-header">
        <h4>Expansion Registry</h4>
        <h1>One platform. N regulated markets.</h1>
        <p>The corridor proved the methodology — statutory scarcity, depletion ledgers, compounding curves. The registry turns that into a rollout.</p>
        <button class="export-btn">↓ Export registry</button>
    </section>

    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <!-- AUDIT TARGET: LIVE REGION CARD             -->
    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <main class="audit-target-wrapper">

        <article class="live-region-card">

            <!-- Card Header -->
            <div class="card-top-row">
                <div class="card-title-group">
                    <span class="status-badge">Live Region</span>
                    <h2 class="region-name">
                        <!-- Simple SVG Icon for visual fidelity -->
                        <svg class="globe-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path></svg>
                        Columbia River Gorge National Scenic Area
                    </h2>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 1) AGGREGATE TILES -->
            <div class="metrics-grid">

                <!-- Tile 1: Markets -->
                <div class="metric-tile">
                    <span class="metric-label">Markets</span>
                    <div>
                        <div class="metric-value">11</div>
                        <div class="metric-sub">Active zones</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Tile 2: Listings -->
                <div class="metric-tile">
                    <span class="metric-label">Listings</span>
                    <div>
                        <div class="metric-value">16</div>
                        <div class="metric-sub">Under 1986 Act</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Tile 3: Net Buildable -->
                <div class="metric-tile">
                    <span class="metric-label">Net Buildable</span>
                    <div>
                        <div class="metric-value">2.4k<span style="font-size:14px; color:#888"> ac</span></div>
                        <div class="metric-sub">Scarcity adjusted</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Tile 4: Avg CAGR -->
                <div class="metric-tile">
                    <span class="metric-label">Avg CAGR</span>
                    <div>
                        <div class="metric-value">8.4<span style="font-size:14px; color:#888">%</span></div>
                        <div class="metric-sub">5yr compounding</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Tile 5: Median Baseline -->
                <div class="metric-tile">
                    <span class="metric-label">Median Baseline</span>
                    <div>
                        <div class="metric-value">$1.2<span style="font-size:14px; color:#888">M</span></div>
                        <div class="metric-sub">Per parcel value</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- 2) CTA BUTTON -->
            <div class="cta-container">
                <button class="cta-button">
                    Open the corridor ledger
                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line></svg>
                </button>
            </div>

        </article>

        <!-- VERDICT REPORT -->
        <aside class="verdict-section">
            <div class="verdict-title">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"></path><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"></path></svg>
                Audit Verdict: Live-Region Card
            </div>
            <ul class="verdict-list">
                <li class="verdict-item">
                    <span class="check-mark">✓</span>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Aggregate Tiles (Verdict 1):</strong> PASS. The card displays exactly five distinct tiles (Markets, Listings, Net Buildable, Avg CAGR, Median Baseline). Values are rendered in high-contrast white against the dark substrate with legible secondary metadata.
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="verdict-item">
                    <span class="check-mark">✓</span>
                    <div>
                        <strong>CTA Visibility (Verdict 2):</strong> PASS. The 'Open the corridor ledger' button is positioned in the standard action dock (bottom-right). It utilizes the emerald accent color for borders and text, maintaining consistency with the card's active status border and the platform's primary brand identity.
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="verdict-item">
                    <span class="check-mark">✓</span>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Layout Integrity (Verdict 3):</strong> PASS. No overlap or clipping detected. The CSS Grid layout for metrics provides adequate gutter spacing (16px), and the padding (24px) ensures content does not bleed into the emerald border.
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </aside>

    </main>

</div>

</body>
</html>
